<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Vaishnavi | Portfolio</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #34021c;
      --accent: #f167bc;
      --text: #eaccdd;
      --card: rgba(239, 33, 129, 0.06);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #30041b, #17020e);
      color: var(--text);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* Navbar */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 15px 40px;
      z-index: 1000;
    }

    nav .logo {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    nav ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    nav ul li a {
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .

    nav ul li a:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding-top: 70px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #ed43ce);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 600px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin: 10px auto 25px;
    }

    .hero button {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #3b82f6);
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .hero button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent);
    }

    /* About Section */
    section {
      padding: 80px 20px;
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
    }
    .whats{
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .wt{
      display: none;
    }

    h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .about {
      display: flex;
      gap: 40px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .about img {
      width: 220px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 3px solid var(--accent);
    }

    .about p {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 280px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    /* Projects */
    .projects {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    /* Contact Section */
    .contact {
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .contact button {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), #3b82f6);
      border: none;
      padding: 10px 25px;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    }
    .work{
      text-align: justify;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-shadow: #ed43ce;
      display: none;
    }

    @media(max-width:600px) {
      nav ul {
        display: none;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <nav>
    <div class="logo">VAISHNAVI SHARMA</div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
      <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
      <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Hi, I'm <span style="color:#06b6d4;">Vaishnavi</span></h1>
    <p>I'm a Btech pusruing student(2nd year) in miat college Affiliated to AKTU University.</p>
    <button class="btn">Explore My Work</button>
    <div class="work">
      <ul>
        <li>“Exploring DSA and problem-solving on LeetCode.”</li>
        <li>“Currently learning Python and exploring automation using small scripts.”</li>
        <li>“Working on understanding how databases and backend logic connect in web applications.”</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>



  <section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <div class="about">
      <img src="WhatsApp Image 2025-10-31 at 9.39.44 PM.jpeg" alt="profile photo">
      <p>
        I’m a 2nd-year B.Tech student in Computer Science, currently exploring the fundamentals of web development and programming. I enjoy building small projects that help me understand how real-world systems work — from frontend design to basic APIs. I’m constantly learning new tools like JavaScript and Python, and my next goal is to dive deeper into backend development and data structures.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <div class="projects">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Portfolio Website (Frontend Fundamentals)</h3>
        <p>Built a personal portfolio using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to showcase my work and learn responsive design</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>To-Do List App</h3>
        <p>Developed a simple To-Do List using JavaScript with LocalStorage support to save tasks even after reload.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Calculator App</h3>
        <p>perfect for JS fundamentals, logic handling, and UI.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Have a project or collaboration idea?</p>
    <button class="talk" >Let's Talk</button>
    <div class="wt">
      <a class="whats" href="https://wa.me/917505044790">Whatsapp me 💙 </a>
      <br>
      <a class="whats" href="vaishnavi.sharma.cs.2024@miet.ac.in">Mail me 💙 </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2025 Vaishnavi | Made with 💙 and curiosity
  </footer>
</body>
<script>
document.querySelector(".btn").addEventListener("click",()=>{
  document.querySelector(".work").style.display="block"
});
document.querySelector(".btn").addEventListener("dblclick",()=>{
  document.querySelector(".work").style.display="none"
});
document.querySelector(".talk").addEventListener("click",()=>{
  document.querySelector(".wt").style.display="block"
});
document.querySelector(".talk").addEventListener("dblclick",()=>{
  document.querySelector(".wt").style.display="none"
});


</script>

</html>